      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Duplicate feature request, may be merged with:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/let-users-hide-disable-items-on-user-side\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-more-safety-option-to-disable-items-visibility\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/a-way-to-locally-globally-disable-all-vrchat-items-they-are-annoying-clog-up-spa",
