  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It's simple, have an option to disable those features. \n\nWhy?\n\nunnecessary load\n\nPortals aren't too much of an issue but jeez man, Im already tired of loading everyones items, models, not to mention the world that might already be highly unoptimized..\n\nJoin/leave animations are just annoying.. IMO we already get enough of those when users models have \"on wake\" animations/sounds\n\nItems are an annoyance. They all have to be loaded and eventually it DOES get laggy. Im surprised there are no options within the shield settings or just in general to disable them entirely.. \"But you can make an instance and disable them\" no no.. we want an option to disable them for us whenever we want\n\n\"You can hide them individually\" I shouldn't have to. At all, even then, it just hides the mesh renderer and disables particles.. on the item, and leaves a \"phantom placeholder\" so you can click on it again.. Not to mention everything has a hitbox that get's annoying to click on when all items and users have a giant hitbox that blocks everything (different topic but still fits the idea that we need a toggle)\n\nWe only get options like that for Images/prints and Drones, why are we forced to see those? \n\nI understand why we have them in the game but there are lots of environments where they just kill the vibe or at the very least, don't mix well. Also not everyone wants to see them in general because they add little to no value to their experience. They are cool to have but giving us the option to make them visible client side would be nice.\n\nOnly true ways to get around these:\n\n- Make your own instance and disable everything before joining said instance\n\n- Make your own private instance and don't invite anyone",
